	<entityname.Touhou_Enchantingstation>附魔台</entityname.Touhou_Enchantingstation>
	<entitydescription.Touhou_Enchantingstation>通过三种附魔材料赋予物品词缀，以此获取更多效果</entitydescription.Touhou_Enchantingstation>
	<!-- Custom button texts -->
	<enchantingstation.enchant>附魔</enchantingstation.enchant>
	<entityname.affixes_1>附魔核心</entityname.affixes_1>
	<entitydescription.affixes_1>效果最好的附魔材料。需要在附魔台内附魔</entitydescription.affixes_1>
	<entityname.affixes_2>附魔棱镜</entityname.affixes_2>
	<entitydescription.affixes_2>效果适中的附魔材料。需要在附魔台内附魔</entitydescription.affixes_2>
	<entityname.affixes_3>附魔合金</entityname.affixes_3>
	<entitydescription.affixes_3>效果最差的附魔材料。需要在附魔台内附魔</entitydescription.affixes_3>
	<entityname.affixes_stone>附魔石</entityname.affixes_stone>
	<entitydescription.affixes_stone>万能的词缀载体。可以先在附魔台给它附上任意词缀，再把它与目标物品一起放入附魔台，消耗它将词缀转移给目标物品</entitydescription.affixes_stone>

	<!-- UI labels -->
	<enchantingstation.input>输入</enchantingstation.input>
	<enchantingstation.output>输出</enchantingstation.output>
	<enchantingstation.invalidinput>附魔</enchantingstation.invalidinput>
	<enchantingstation.empty.infotext>放入附魔材料（在仪式台制作）</enchantingstation.empty.infotext>
  
